1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,100
Cześć!

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:08,780
Wrocław mixes between trade and architecture,

3
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:13,540
and one of the places we
can be witnessing this

4
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:16,500
mixture is in Świdnicka 40,

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,060
the department store of Renoma.

6
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:25,500
This department store opened on 2 April 1930.

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,320
Back then it was called Wertheim.

8
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:35,460
Even back then, it was a very
impressive and modern department store.

9
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:39,100
It was ruined during the Second World War

10
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:42,700
and reopened in 1977.

11
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:49,500
What's very impressive about this
place is the external façade,

12
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:54,640
in which you can see the colorful tiles

13
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:59,300
and the golden decorations around
it, the gilded decorations,

14
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:04,000
as well as 40 different portfolios.

15
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:08,020
Not only is it impressive
from the outside, it's also

16
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:12,820
very impressive from the inside. You
can see behind me that it's quite a

17
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:17,200
luxurious department store
with high-end brands.

18
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:21,020
Moreover, it hosts the food court called PeDeT

19
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:25,500
that we talked about in
one of our recent posts,

20
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:30,880
that offers different styles of cuisine,

21
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:35,700
as well as a big bar in the middle,

22
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:41,660
and also hosts musical events
and other kinds of entertainment.

23
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:47,980
So I really recommend coming and
visiting this amazing department store,

24
00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:50,200
Renoma in Wrocław.

25
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:53,500
See you in our next video. Do widzenia!
